From 96f4a56719197b67ce95d8790dd3ef09590804d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 00:03:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] upscalers: Fetch Streamline for OptiScaler nightlies.

Install the verified official x64 Streamline runtime beside private
nightly libraries, retaining licence notices and linking managed DLSS
DLLs instead of installing duplicate copies.

Track updates separately from OptiScaler and reuse the existing cache
and rollback helpers. Keep working installations on download failures,
respect untracked files, and leave stable-channel setup unchanged.

Test runtime selection, dependency links, offline fallback, channel
gating and failed-update rollback.
